  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving Food Security and Economic Opportunities in Paraguay&apos;s Concepcion Department</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This amendment provides OCRC with an additional 24 months and $ 150,000 to continue strengthening income-generating activities for OCRC and its members and enhancing the leadership potential of women and youth. OCRC is also strengthening networks where women and youth throughout the department connect to share experiences and develop inclusive policy proposals. As part of the amendment, OCRC is mobilizing an additional $221,260 in counterpart resources to the grant agreement.</narrative>
  </description>
